{"id":"torrey:dove-the","source":"torrey","name":"Dove, The","slug":"dove-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Clean and used as food — De 14:11.","refs":[["Deut",14,11,14,11]]},{"text":"Offered in sacrifice — Ge 15:9; Le 1:14.","refs":[["Gen",15,9,15,9],["Lev",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"Impiously sold in the court of the temple — Mt 21:12; Joh 2:16.","refs":[["Matt",21,12,21,12],["John",2,16,2,16]]},{"text":"Simplicity. — Mt 10:16.","refs":[["Matt",10,16,10,16]]},{"text":"Comeliness of countenance. — Song 2:14.","refs":[["Song",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Softness of eyes. — Song 1:15.","refs":[["Song",1,15,1,15]]},{"text":"Sweetness of voice. — Song 2:14.","refs":[["Song",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Richness of plumage. — Ps 68:13.","refs":[["Ps",68,13,68,13]]},{"text":"Mournful tabering of, alluded to — Na 2:7.","refs":[["Nah",2,7,2,7]]},{"text":"Dwells in rocks — Song 2:14; Jer 48:28.","refs":[["Song",2,14,2,14],["Jer",48,28,48,28]]},{"text":"Frequents streams and rivers — Song 5:12.","refs":[["Song",5,12,5,12]]},{"text":"Sent from the ark by Noah — Ge 8:8,10,12.","refs":[["Gen",8,8,8,8],["Gen",8,10,8,10],["Gen",8,12,8,12]]},{"text":"Why considered the emblem of peace — Ge 8:11.","refs":[["Gen",8,11,8,11]]},{"text":"The harbinger of spring — Song 2:12.","refs":[["Song",2,12,2,12]]},{"text":"Of the Holy Spirit. — Mt 3:16; Joh 1:32.","refs":[["Matt",3,16,3,16],["John",1,32,1,32]]},{"text":"Of the meekness of Christ. — Song 5:12.","refs":[["Song",5,12,5,12]]},{"text":"Of the church. — Song 2:14; 5:2.","refs":[["Song",2,14,2,14],["Song",5,2,5,2]]},{"text":"Of mourners. — Isa 38:14; 59:11.","refs":[["Isa",38,14,38,14],["Isa",59,11,59,11]]},{"text":"Of converts to the church. — Isa 60:8.","refs":[["Isa",60,8,60,8]]},{"text":"(In its flight,) of the return of Israel from captivity. — Ho 11:11.","refs":[["Hos",11,11,11,11]]}],"refCount":28}
